    "strengths": {
      "bestArea": "Finishing at the rim — career 73.8% FG on 149 attempts (Excellent, 99th and 89th percentile in the two seasons with data), including a perfect 100% on 27 career dunk attempts. This is an elite, high-volume, high-confidence strength.",
