      "overallStrength": "A high-efficiency interior finisher whose offense is almost entirely created for him — cuts, rolls, and putbacks — rather than self-created, and he converts at an elite rate once he gets the look. Career 2023-24 data isn't available for play-type detail (see note on that season), but the shot chart confirms the same pattern: he was already a plus finisher at the rim then too."
